    "description": "<p>You superheat the air around your enemies, causing them to become so weak and dehydrated they can barely move.</p><p>Choose a point within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. Each enemy within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of that point must make an opposed <strong>Resilience</strong> check or suffer the below effects:</p><ul><li><p>Their <strong>Speed</strong> decreases by <strong>-5</strong>, to a minimum of 1.</p></li><li><p>They cannot <strong>Charge</strong>.</p></li></ul><p>This effect lasts until the start of your next turn.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.AZWdUeIhXOOdUsBS]{Parch}</p>",
